{#- The editor that replaced Decap. Decap died with Netlify Identity at the
   2026-08-15 cutover, and this is the piece that had been missing since.

   ONE LANGUAGE AT A TIME, with English beside it for reference. Copy is
   written by a person working in one language; three editable columns is a
   spreadsheet, and a spreadsheet is not how anybody writes a sentence.
   English shows because a translator needs the source, and it is read-only
   here for the same reason the columns are not all editable — you are working
   on one language, and the other is context. -#}

<div class="ms-bar c-bar">
  <label class="c-pick">
    <span data-i18n="con.editing">Editing</span>
    <select id="cLang" disabled></select>
  </label>
  <label class="c-pick" id="cRefWrap" hidden>
    <span data-i18n="con.reference">Reference</span>
    <select id="cRef" disabled></select>
  </label>
  <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="cAddLang" disabled
          data-i18n="con.addLang">Add a language</button>


  {#- ALWAYS ENABLED, including when the page thinks nothing has changed.

     Save is hidden when nothing is dirty, and that is correct — there is no
     such thing as committing a file that is identical to the one already
     there; git has nothing to record. But "nothing has changed" is a claim
     about the copy this page loaded, and if somebody edited the same file
     elsewhere, or a save half-failed, the honest remedy is to go and look
     again rather than to force a commit that would be empty. -#}
  <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="cReload"
          data-i18n="con.reload">Reload from GitHub</button>
  <span class="hint" id="cWhere"></span>
</div>

{#- Shown instead of the editor when GITHUB_TOKEN is absent. A page that says
   what is missing is worth more than one that fails to load, especially since
   the missing thing is a deliberate act somebody has to perform. -#}
<p class="rolegate" id="cNotConfigured" hidden></p>

<div class="adm-content" id="cRoot" hidden>
  <nav class="c-sections" id="cSections" aria-label="Sections"></nav>
  <div class="c-panel">
    <div class="c-search">
      <input type="search" id="cFind" autocomplete="off"
             placeholder="Find a word or phrase…" aria-label="Find a word or phrase…"
             data-i18n-attr="placeholder:con.find,aria-label:con.find">
      <span class="c-count" id="cCount"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="c-rows" id="cRows"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="ms-savebar" id="cSaveBar" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
  <span class="ms-dirty-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span id="cDirtyCount">0 unsaved changes</span>
  <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="cDiscard" data-i18n="ms.discard">Discard</button>
  <button type="button" class="solid-btn" id="cSave" data-i18n="con.save">Save</button>
</div>
